WEBVTT

00:00:03.386 --> 00:00:05.455
(grunts fiercely)

00:00:05.554 --> 00:00:08.024
(laughing, whooping)

00:00:08.124 --> 00:00:10.059
(screams)

00:00:10.159 --> 00:00:11.227
(alarm blaring)

00:00:11.327 --> 00:00:12.996
(whimpers)

00:00:17.566 --> 00:00:20.069
RALPH:
<i>Oh, strudel.</i>

00:00:20.169 --> 00:00:22.171
("Double Life"
by Pharrell Williams playing)

00:00:22.271 --> 00:00:24.107
(screaming)

00:00:24.207 --> 00:00:25.842
- ♪ Hey, what are you hiding?
- (laughing)

00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:27.509
♪ Whatcha doing when you gone?

00:00:27.609 --> 00:00:28.811
(screams, shouts in Minionese)

00:00:28.911 --> 00:00:30.512
♪ Nothing wrong being private

00:00:30.612 --> 00:00:32.248
♪ Make sure it ain't wrong

00:00:32.348 --> 00:00:34.484
- ♪ Your life double-sided
- (electrical humming)

00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:35.952
- ♪ Two-faced like coins
- Huh?

00:00:36.052 --> 00:00:38.121
- (grunts, laughs)
- ♪ What side do I get?

00:00:38.221 --> 00:00:39.989
- ♪ Which side are you on?
- (shouts in Minionese)

00:00:40.089 --> 00:00:42.691
- ♪ So what have you done?
- (electrical crackling)

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:43.926
- ♪ Some of your dirt
- (whooping)

00:00:44.027 --> 00:00:45.461
- ♪ Has come to light
- Oh?

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.829
<i>♪ Why were you ♪</i>

00:00:46.929 --> 00:00:48.597
- ♪ Speeding up that hill
- (gasps)

00:00:48.697 --> 00:00:50.166
- ♪ Until the brakes came off?
- (sneezes)

00:00:50.266 --> 00:00:51.566
(groans)

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:53.202
♪ And someone saw you
in a fight ♪

00:00:53.302 --> 00:00:54.636
- (blowing)
- <i>♪ Am I right? ♪</i>

00:00:54.736 --> 00:00:56.472
- (belches thunderously)
- (screaming)

00:00:56.571 --> 00:00:58.174
(laughing)

00:00:58.274 --> 00:01:00.376
♪ It doesn't matter to you
if you get heads or tails ♪

00:01:00.476 --> 00:01:02.611
- (shouts angrily in Minionese)
- (screams, high-pitched yell)

00:01:02.711 --> 00:01:03.813
♪ You just don't like to flip

00:01:03.913 --> 00:01:05.281
- ♪ All the time
- (chuckling)

00:01:05.381 --> 00:01:06.916
- (giggling, grunting)
- ♪ But if you spin it

00:01:07.016 --> 00:01:09.584
♪ Then you get to see
both sides ♪

00:01:09.684 --> 00:01:12.155
♪ Oh, the thrill
of the double life ♪

00:01:12.255 --> 00:01:13.588
Uh, whoops.

00:01:13.688 --> 00:01:15.324
- ♪ Lie detector time
- (chuckling)

00:01:15.425 --> 00:01:16.758
(screams, whimpers)

00:01:16.859 --> 00:01:19.594
♪ Do you feel bad
when you lie? ♪

00:01:20.695 --> 00:01:22.265
- ♪ The look on your face says
- (chattering)

00:01:22.365 --> 00:01:24.599
♪ "The best life"

00:01:24.699 --> 00:01:27.537
♪ And then come home
like it's fine ♪

00:01:27.636 --> 00:01:29.872
- ♪ Am I right?
- (excited chatter)

00:01:33.076 --> 00:01:35.311
♪ I know you heard the rumors

00:01:35.411 --> 00:01:36.979
- ♪ You must get over to it
- (excited chatter)

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:39.048
- ♪ Right away
- (all grunt)

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:43.019
- ♪ If anyone can do it
- (whimpers, shouts)

00:01:43.119 --> 00:01:44.653
- ♪ You gotta get there soon
- (laughing)

00:01:44.753 --> 00:01:46.688
♪ It's not okay

00:01:46.789 --> 00:01:48.558
♪ You got cars to drive

00:01:48.657 --> 00:01:50.793
♪ Plenty jets to fly

00:01:50.893 --> 00:01:52.195
- ♪ When will you arrive?
- (panicked grunting)

00:01:52.295 --> 00:01:54.629
- ♪ You're running outta time
- (screams)

00:01:54.729 --> 00:01:55.932
♪ Don't you see that

00:01:56.032 --> 00:01:58.067
♪ Everything is on the line?

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:00.002
- Hmm. Okay, come in.
- ♪ So I'm sorry

00:02:00.103 --> 00:02:01.871
♪ But you have to
choose a side ♪

00:02:01.971 --> 00:02:03.638
- Bello.
- (frantic yelling)

00:02:03.738 --> 00:02:05.740
♪ You never know
when it's your time to go ♪

00:02:05.842 --> 00:02:07.343
- (grunting wildly)
- ♪ It's now or never

00:02:07.443 --> 00:02:09.278
- (exhausted panting)
- ♪ On this everything rides

00:02:09.378 --> 00:02:11.114
(laughing)

00:02:11.214 --> 00:02:13.249
- ♪ Before the spinning stops
- No. No, no, no. (screams)

00:02:13.349 --> 00:02:15.451
♪ You must pick a side

00:02:15.551 --> 00:02:17.652
Ooh. (munches loudly)

00:02:17.752 --> 00:02:19.589
<i>♪ Who will you be tonight? ♪</i>

00:02:19.688 --> 00:02:20.923
<i>♪ That's the question ♪</i>

00:02:21.023 --> 00:02:22.992
<i>♪ Who will Gru be tonight? ♪</i>

00:02:23.092 --> 00:02:23.860
(yelling)

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:25.595
<i>♪ That's the question ♪</i>

00:02:25.694 --> 00:02:27.629
- ♪ The double life.
- (song ends)

00:02:27.729 --> 00:02:30.032
- (gasps, whimpers) Uh, uh-oh.
- (rumbling)

00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:31.367
(all screaming)

00:02:31.467 --> 00:02:33.136
(sighs)

00:02:33.236 --> 00:02:35.204
♪

00:02:37.206 --> 00:02:38.341
(grunting)

00:02:38.441 --> 00:02:40.943
(yelps, screams)

00:02:46.115 --> 00:02:48.117
♪

00:02:50.453 --> 00:02:52.687
(whimpering, yelling)

00:02:55.525 --> 00:02:57.860
♪

00:03:10.705 --> 00:03:13.009
(munching loudly)

00:03:14.177 --> 00:03:15.244
(gasps, screams)

00:03:15.344 --> 00:03:17.046
(seagull screeches)

00:03:17.146 --> 00:03:19.081
♪

00:03:32.295 --> 00:03:35.031
(seagull squawking)

00:03:35.131 --> 00:03:36.265
(grumbles)

00:03:37.333 --> 00:03:39.001
(groans)

00:03:40.603 --> 00:03:42.972
♪

00:03:56.652 --> 00:03:58.988
(grunting)

00:04:02.525 --> 00:04:04.759
(grunting, panting)

00:04:06.395 --> 00:04:08.397
(gasping frantically)

00:04:08.497 --> 00:04:10.866
♪

00:04:30.086 --> 00:04:31.621
(grunts)

00:04:31.721 --> 00:04:33.689
Blah, blah, blah,
blah, blah, blah.

00:04:33.789 --> 00:04:35.258
Blah, blah, blah.

00:04:35.358 --> 00:04:37.159
(sighs)

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:38.694
Ooh-la-la.

00:04:38.794 --> 00:04:40.696
(grunting)

00:04:40.796 --> 00:04:42.565
(straining)

00:04:42.665 --> 00:04:45.034
♪

00:04:56.145 --> 00:04:58.347
(Minion vocalizing melody)

00:05:09.692 --> 00:05:11.560
(vocalizing stops)

00:05:11.661 --> 00:05:14.030
♪

00:05:30.513 --> 00:05:32.348
Hey-hey! Bello! (chuckles)

00:05:32.448 --> 00:05:33.783
(stammers)

00:05:33.883 --> 00:05:36.152
Oh. (laughing nervously)

00:05:38.487 --> 00:05:41.157
(laughing trails off)

00:05:41.257 --> 00:05:43.225
♪

00:05:56.672 --> 00:05:59.241
(whistling melodically)

00:06:02.745 --> 00:06:04.613
(whistling fades)

00:06:04.714 --> 00:06:07.083
♪

00:06:36.746 --> 00:06:39.115
♪

00:06:50.726 --> 00:06:53.028
(grunting)

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.932
♪

00:07:26.695 --> 00:07:29.565
(music fades)

00:07:29.665 --> 00:07:31.467
(snoring)

00:07:36.639 --> 00:07:37.973
- (grunts)
- (whimpers)

00:07:38.073 --> 00:07:41.243
- (shouting frantically)
- (laughing)

